From 84535b43ff43db237a255f896bdf718b7228a450 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carl Kho <kho@uni.minerva.edu>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:06:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: add a ctrl+k quick switcher

Jumps to any server, channel or conversation by name, with arrow keys and
enter driving the list so the caret never leaves the field.

Matching is deliberately forgiving, in three tiers: a prefix beats a
substring, a substring beats characters merely appearing in order. Everything
compares lowercased, so capitalisation never decides whether a result shows
up.

The keybind filter suppresses ctrl+k while a modal is open, which also stops
the switcher stacking a second copy of itself on every press.
